 heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Less noise</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">No person to complain about is nobody to disturb you.</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 402.048px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Heat issues</b></span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>:</b> </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> It will get very hot during those long, hot summer days unless you have good ventilation in your apartment.</span></p></td></tr><tr data-row-info=\"{\" id\":\"rw-zprh6rdaka0v\",\"type\":\"row\"}\"=\"\"><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"0\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 271.968px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Increased security</span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">:</span></b><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"> It is much harder for would-be burglars to find their way into the penthouse apartment.</span></p></td><td class=\"zw-td\" col-index=\"1\" data-cell-height=\"auto\" style=\"border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); padding: 7.97px 0px; width: 402.048px; height: auto; vertical-align: top;\"><p data-header=\"0\" class=\"zw-paragraph heading0\" data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"10.50\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data-hd-info=\"0\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\"><b>Longer elevator waits</b></span><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">: </span><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">f the building has an elevator, plan on waiting longer to enter your apartment.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">A top-floor residence is considered a premium because of the privacy that can be achieved along with the view obtained, though it costs more money than its counterpart.<br></span></span></span></p><h2 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Lifestyle Considerations</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocgpw6eh0z9wex\",\"id\":\"toc_rpem611qvenc\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_rpem611qvenc\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocgpw6eh0z9wex\",\"id\":\"toc_rpem611qvenc\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_rpem611qvenc\"> </span></b></h2><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Your lifestyle will determine which floor is best suited for you.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Family Dynamics</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocbnzs3s4pvf2f\",\"id\":\"toc_h81g1ovqkixx\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_h81g1ovqkixx\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_tocbnzs3s4pvf2f\",\"id\":\"toc_h81g1ovqkixx\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_h81g1ovqkixx\"> </span></b></h3><p data-textformat=\"{\" fgc\":\"rgb(0,=\"\" 0,=\"\" 0)\",\"size\":\"12.00\",\"type\":\"text\"}\"=\"\" data-margin-bottom=\"12pt\" data_styles=\"{\" data-line-height=\"1.2\" class=\"zw-paragraph\" style=\"margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-left: 0px; line-height: 1.2;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Ground or middle floors may work when there are little children or aged people with you because access is easier, and safety issues are better manageable. A top floor may suit you when you are a young couple that requires greater privacy.</span></p><h3 style=\"margin: 18pt 0px 6pt; line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">Health and Mobility Concerns</span><span data-range-char-type=\"start\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc6g8j1g230j2k\",\"id\":\"toc_ycbkly5sm22x\",\"type\":\"bookmark\",\"render_type\":\"inline\",\"geo_transformation\":{\"translation\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"scaling\":{\"x\":false,\"y\":false},\"rotation\":false}}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ycbkly5sm22x\"> </span><span data-range-char-type=\"end\" data-bookmark-info=\"{\" name\":\"_toc6g8j1g230j2k\",\"id\":\"toc_ycbkly5sm22x\",\"type\":\"bookmark\"}\"=\"\" data-bookmark-id=\"toc_ycbkly5sm22x\"> </span></b></h3><p></p><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">Therefore, for those with health or mobility issues, ground-floor flats are easier to access without the need to climb the stairs or use the elevator.</span></span></p><h2><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span data-char-style-info=\"Heading2Char\" style=\"font-family: Roboto; font-size: 18pt; font-weight: 700;\">Conclusion</span></span></h2><p><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline;\">While each floor has pros and cons, which floor would be perfect to live in a building pretty much depends on what a homerenter likes. If someone would be worried about the access of amenities that are located in different floors, then consider <a href=\"https://www.kots.world/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">KOTS.</a></span></span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p></div>",
